From: Hemanth Kumar M <hemanthkumarm@ami.com>
Date: Thu, 15 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] bmc: PLDM bundle tool, raw PLDM upload support, and activation improvements

Combines the following changes:
 - Add pldm-bundle-extraction-tool (C++ helper for PLDM bundle extraction)
 - image_manager: support raw PLDM package upload (detect, stage, version)
 - image_manager: bypass untar for raw PLDM uploads
 - activation: skip signature verification for raw PLDM uploads
 - item_updater: allow all valid (non-Unknown) purposes for activation
 - activation: decide reboot from fwupd marker only after flash completes
 - package_parser: use libpldm crc32 fallback for OT-PLDM compatibility

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [AMI-specific fwupd integration]

Signed-off-by: Hemanth Kumar M <hemanthkumarm@ami.com>
